Z||000003||Raydar||08-10-2001||09:30 AM||||Hugh,<P>The Trans Sport wheels are 5X115. Fiero is 5X100.<P>Check this link... <A HREF="http://www.aaarims.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.aaarims.com/</A>  If you ever see wheels that you like on a particular car, find 'em here. They give the size and bolt circle.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
